# Changelog (law)

Read skill **forja-changelog** when editing release notes or shipping user-visible changes.

| Law | |
|-----|--|
| User-visible → update active `docs/changelog/*-[draft].md` | Same turn as code |
| Prefixes only | `**Add:**` · `**Change:**` · `**Fix:**` · `**Remove:**` |
| Final truth only | Edit/remove bullets; no wrong-attempt history |
| Version & codename external | Release admin + `kReleaseCodename` — not the draft title |
| User-facing bullets | No RFC/issue IDs, file paths, or crate names |

Groups (Features · Player · UI · Sources · Live & IPTV · TV) and freeze/CI detail → skill **forja-changelog**.
